5. DIFFICULTIES OR BLOCKERS ENCOUNTERED

Blocker 1: LocalStorage Sync Issue
Problem: After edit or delete, old data appeared after refresh.
Reason: Array and LocalStorage were not in sync.
Solution: Created single function syncAndRender().
This function first updates array, then saves to storage,
then renders UI. This is modern state pattern.

Blocker 2: Dynamic Buttons Not Working
Problem: Edit and Delete buttons created by JavaScript
were not responding to clicks.
Solution: Used ID-based pattern with onclick="deleteTask(id)"
and used array filter method to find correct task.

Blocker 3: Footer Overlapping on Mobile
Problem: Footer was overlapping content on FAQ page.
Solution: Applied modern flex layout:
body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
}
main {
  flex: 1;
}

Blocker 4: GitHub Live Not Updating
Problem: Changes were not visible on live link.
Solution: Learned correct git flow:
git add . -> git commit -> git push
and used Ctrl + F5 for hard refresh.

Final Learning: Improved from code that just works
to efficient and professional code.

